+    ``DAS__LLM__API_KEY`` maps to ``llm.api_key``. For a map field such as
+    ``webhook_secrets``, ``DAS__WEBHOOK_SECRETS__PARTNER_A`` maps to
+    ``webhook_secrets.partner_a`` (Phase 4 Req 1.7).
